          "settings": {
            "heading": "Specifications",
            "icon": "none",
            "content": "<p><strong>Organic Snooze Nest Firm-Safe Crib Mattress</strong></p><ul><li>Dimensions: 28\" x 52\" (standard U.S. crib size), 5\" height&nbsp;</li><li>Flippable, dual-sided design with both sides identical&nbsp;</li><li>Firm, flat, supportive feel, built for infant safety&nbsp;</li><li>Fully breathable layered construction&nbsp;</li><li>Organic cotton woven cover&nbsp;</li><li>Pressure-tested for safety&nbsp;</li><li>Bed frame not included</li></ul><p><strong>100% Organic Nest Sheets</strong></p><ul><li>Non-Toxic&nbsp;</li><li>Breathable Cotton sheets</li><li>White</li></ul><p><strong>100% Organic Nest Waterproof Protector</strong></p><ul><li><strong>Waterproof</strong></li><li><strong>Machine Washable</strong></li><li><strong>No PVC</strong></li></ul><p></p>",
