            "icon": "none",
            "content": "<p>The Snooze Nest is a flippable, firm-safe dual-sided system with three natural layers on each side:&nbsp;</p><ul><li><strong>1.5\" Organic Wool</strong>—comfort and temperature regulation; wicks moisture and acts as a natural fire barrier&nbsp;</li><li><strong>1\" Organic Hemp</strong>—breathable supportive layer that adds airflow and resists moisture, mold, and bacteria&nbsp;</li><li><strong>2\" Coconut Coir</strong>—firm core support that gives the flat, stable surface recommended for infant sleep and holds its shape over time&nbsp;</li><li><strong>Wrapped in an organic cotton woven cover.</strong> No polyurethane foams, no chemical flame retardants, no synthetic adhesives, no VOCs.</li><li><strong>Waterproof Protector and Sheets</strong> - 100% Cotton</li></ul>",
